---
import TuitionRates from "./TuitionRates.astro";
---

<section id="tuition" class="@container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-24">
  <div class="text-center">
    <h2>Tuition</h2>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-pretty">
      Tuition is paid monthly for the 9.5-month school year (early September through mid-June),
      due on the 15th of the month before care is given, and stays the same regardless of
      illness, vacation, or closures. Rates include meals, snacks, sunscreen, and diapering
      supplies, and we accept ERDC and other subsidies along with partial scholarships for
      families who qualify. We're open Monday through Friday, 7:30am to 5:30pm; changing or
      canceling a schedule requires 30 days' written notice.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12">
    <TuitionRates />
  </div>
</section>
